<title>USA: Paxar names CEO of European operations.</title>
<headline>Paxar names CEO of European operations.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paxar Corp said Wednesday it has named James Wrigley chief executive of its European operations.</p>
<p>Previously, the company's European operations reported to Paxar Chairman and Chief Executive Arthur Hershaft.</p>
<p>Most recently, Wrigley was international director of Pepe Group PLC, which markets jeans.</p>
